      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Original foreground fixtures - MIT",
      "description": "Original labeled-mask images, expected masks, generator and graph under the repository's MIT license. Run all for nine acquisitions. Two warmup activations emit no primary data. Counts from frame 2 onward are 1,1,0,0,0,1,0. A disjoint moving part confirms after three consecutive unambiguous observations. Missing frame 4 resets it; reappearance requires confirmation again. Glints in frames 1 and 3 never confirm. Label 127 is excluded by threshold 127; isolated pixels are below minimum area. Green boxes mean confirmed; amber boxes mean pending. All geometry is current-grid pixels. No old mask or old ticket is re-emitted. This is component debounce, not general identity tracking or occlusion recovery. API: https://docs.opencv.org/5.0/main_modules/imgproc_shape.html",
